class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal D\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathbf a\">\\(A\\in\\mathbf a\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c98b19cc764c238f\" href=\"?note=c98b19cc764c238f\" title=\"20-df-deg\">20-df-deg</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2e0726b34b0b1c40\" href=\"?note=2e0726b34b0b1c40\" title=\"20-df-domination\">20-df-domination</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a>。</p>\n<p>上标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{tot}\">\\(\\mathrm{tot}\\)</span> 表示全定义限制：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\">\\(\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\\)</span>；相对族采用同一限制。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hyperimmune\\text{-}free}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{HIF}(\\mathbf a)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall f\\in(\\mathcal C_1^A)^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\exists g\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ [f\\le^*g].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hyperimmune\\text{-}free}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{HIF}(\\mathbf a)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall f\\in(\\mathcal C_1^A)^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\exists g\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ [f\\le^*g].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>代表元无关，由相互 oracle 模拟保证。这里每个函数分别有一个界，不要求统一找界的索引。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 5.6.1；印刷页 124；PDF 第 159 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-deg","status":"resolved","id":"c98b19cc764c238f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-deg]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-domination","status":"resolved","id":"2e0726b34b0b1c40","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-domination]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-oracle-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-deg","status":"resolved","id":"c98b19cc764c238f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-deg]]；see [[20-df-domination]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-domination","status":"resolved","id":"2e0726b34b0b1c40","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-deg]]；see [[20-df-domination]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-oracle-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-deg]]；see [[20-df-domination]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status